# 雅俗共赏 — 规则（配合 yasugongshang.js 使用）
[rewrite_local]
^https?:\/\/apps-api\.(lianaishouce|lingege)\.cn\/user\/(public\/login.*|getUserInfo) url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincent-ou/QuantumultX/refs/heads/main/Collections/yasugongshang.js

